urceFigureAsset, SourceVisualReceipt, rights/display, launch, official scoring, or student-display-final acceptance is made.\n- The plan requires fresh human authorization in the new parent epic before any VLM execution.\n\n## Plan highlights\n- Separates `asset_production_ready` from `student_display_eligible_final`.\n- Proposes a 16-issue chain covering source map, source page render, VLM packet generation, Wave 1 VLM, crop materialization, crop QA, SourceVisualReceipt production, production index, runtime delta, bulk waves, and closeout.\n- Preserves no remote Supabase mutation, no launch-ready claim, no official scoring claim, and no VLM-based acceptance.\n\n## Verification\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run quality:report-index`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`","created_at":"2026-07-04T04:05:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T04:09:51Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T04:09:51Z","merged_at":"2026-07-04T04:09:51Z","merge_commit_sha":"e162e0c5785c05b2fdf1919c216d03d12fc9f32a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1242/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1242/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1242/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/68aadc4681c0a49b2c61164f6e6046c57f5b392a","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/figureasset-precise-crop-qa-plan","ref":"codex/figureasset-precise-crop-qa-plan","sha":"68aadc4681c0a49b2c61164f6e6046c57f5b392a","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://g